<view class="package-page"><image class="package-bg" src="/images/runtime/team-data-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="package-content"><view class="package-nav"><text class="package-back" bindtap="back">‹</text><text>球队数据包</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="package-loading">正在读取组别数据…</view><block wx:else><view class="package-group"><text>组别信息</text><view><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-02.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>赛事</text><text>{{tournament.name}}</text></view><view><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-03.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>组别</text><text>{{division.name}}</text><text>基础版 · 已锁定</text></view></view><view class="package-hero"><text>球队数据包</text><view wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="title" class="package-feature"><image src="{{item.icon}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{item.title}}</text></view></view></view><view class="package-scope"><text>边界说明</text><view><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-03.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>只为本队保存球员数据，不升级主办方赛事版本</text></view><view><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-03.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>不生成赛事官方球员榜单</text></view><view><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-03.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>另一支球队是否开通互不影响</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{isProfessional}}" class="package-info">{{subtitle}}</view><button wx:elif="{{isEnabled}}" bindtap="openData">{{primaryText}}</button><button wx:else bindtap="request" disabled="{{!canRequest || isRequested || requesting}}">{{primaryText}}</button><button class="package-later" bindtap="back">暂不开通</button><text class="package-footnote">仅当组别锁定为基础版后显示；专业级组别已包含球队数据能力，不显示购买入口。</text></block></view></view>
